# A word that, one way through, reaches deeper than it surely uses moves
# its caller's values, and so does a word that calls it: what was known of
# their kinds is not, after either call.
# expect: x 4 y 4
define c if 2 roll then end
define b c end
define d c 0 end
1 str x 3 true b add
1 str y 3 true d drop add
